	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Recte vero cogitas, quales hic habeamus homines <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>in republica, atque utinam non potentiores pene omnes <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ita essent affecti!</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Pauci supersunt in senatu (ex <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>inferioribus tamen), qui libertatem salvam retinere <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>velint.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Pessimum est, quod religio et salus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>fidelium eorumque petitiones ubique praetexuntur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ea <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>specie seducuntur simpliciores ex civibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Miror vero <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>illos tam patienter nostras contradictiones ferre <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>posse; ringuntur quidem mirum in modum, interea <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>dissimulant; nam saepe expectavi, ut vocaremur <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ad senatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed fortassis conclusionem expectant, ut <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>postea communi authoritate <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nos premant.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dominus frangat <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ipsorum consilia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Potes cogitare, quę sit sors nostra nunc <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>hic docentium et pastorum partes agentium.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Dominus co<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nfirmet et custodiat suos!</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Interea vero nihil am<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>plius in isto negotio actum est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ego pro infoelici <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et infausto omine habeo, quod nuncius, qui cum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>literis nuper <placeName ref="l301">Lugdunum</placeName> ad <placeName>Lemovicensem</placeName> missus est, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>in itinere, antequam ad ipsum perveniret, periit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Uti<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nam sic universa illa machinatio pereat!</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ita <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mihi faustum esset omen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Alias nihil novi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><foreign xml:lang="la">Sumus valde solliciti</foreign> der handlung halb mitt <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>dem herren <persName>von Sax</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Gott schicke es zum besten; dann <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>es möcht wol ein bösen handel gen.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Wil gern <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>hören, was von <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> kömm.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Literas <persName ref="p8009">Fabritii</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>remitto et magnas pro hic gratias ago.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Aliunde <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>iam nihil habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Wir hend die <placeName ref="l167">Genffer</placeName> aber einist <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>gar erzürnt, das wir in das foedus nitt consentierend; <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>si hend uns für grob esel, die wir nun unser und <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nitt der gmeinen kilchen rechnung tragend.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Aber mich <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>dunckt, si wellind uns gern als esel mißbruchen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculi</persName> exemplar ita, ut est, imprimitur;</foreign> so vil <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>hatts gholffen, das man si inen worden; sonst hetten<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>d si gar herrliche locos drus zwacket und an<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ders an dstatt gsetzt.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Si dörffends nun nitt uß<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>lon, so si send, das mans innen worden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Quid prae<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>termittere voluerint, videbis, cum exemplaria fuer<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>int absoluta.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Nihil aliud nunc habeo, nisi quod <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>dominum oro, ut te diutissime ecclesiae suae servet incolumem.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Salutant te d. <persName ref="p8063">Steigerus</persName>, <persName ref="p3494">Diesbachius</persName>, <persName ref="p4060">Zä<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>henderi</persName>, socer, fratres item ac symmystae, praesertim <lb xml:id="p1z44"/><persName ref="p8416">Musculus</persName>, mater item, item et uxor.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>nostro nomine tuos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 10. martii <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>1565.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[o<lb xml:id="p1z47"/>hannes] Hallerus</persName>, semper <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino et compatri mi<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>hi summa semper observantia <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>colendo.</s>
				</p>
